    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Introducing Apartment 5, Block 2, Gateway, a well-located two-bedroom apartment situated within the established Gateway Student Village in Sligo. The property offers an opportunity for investors seeking a fully managed investment within a purpose-built student accommodation development. Gateway Student Village benefits from on-site management, well-maintained communal areas and ample parking. The development is conveniently located within walking distance of Sligo Town Centre and a range of nearby amenities, including shops, a petrol station, Sligo University Hospital and Knocknarea Arena. ATU Sligo is also within easy reach, making the development a convenient option for students attending the campus.Internally, the apartment offers bright and practical accommodation throughout. The entrance hall leads to an open-plan kitchen, living and dining area with tiled flooring. The fully fitted kitchen provides ample storage and workspace, while the adjoining living and dining area offers a comfortable communal space. There are two well-proportioned bedrooms, both with carpet flooring, built-in wardrobes, individual vanity units with wash hand basins and built-in desk areas suitable for study. The accommodation is completed by a shower room, fully tiled from floor to ceiling and fitted with a WC, wash hand basin and mains shower. The property operates under a pooled rent system, providing rental income while reducing the level of day-to-day involvement required from the owner. With its established student setting and convenient access to ATU Sligo and Sligo Town Centre, Apartment 5 offers a practical investment opportunity within the student accommodation market. To make an enquiry or for further information, please contact Oates Breheny Group on 071-9140404."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "ACCOMMODATION\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall  \r\nTiled flooring.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Living/Dining (5.8m x 3.8m) \r\nFully fitted kitchen with tiled flooring and between units, TV point.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 (4.8m x 3.4m) \r\nTwin room, Carpet flooring, Built in wardrobe, Vanity unit with sink, Built in desk unit.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 (3.5m x 2.6m) \r\nDouble room, Carpet flooring, Built in wardrobe, Vanity unit with sink, Built in desk unit.\r\n\r\nShower room (2.1m x 2.0m) \r\nFully tiled floor to ceiling, WC, WHB, Mains shower.\r\n\r\nHot press"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Fully furnished apartment.\r\nElectric storage heating.\r\nPVC double glazed windows and external doors.\r\nWell maintained common areas.\r\nCCTV & security monitoring.\r\nAmple parking available.\r\nLocated on ATU main campus.\r\nPooled rent system.\r\nComplete hands off investment.\r\nWithin walking distance of Sligo town centre.\r\nAmple amenities nearby including shops, gyms, sports facilities and Sligo University Hospital."
